==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Ka-Boom or Not To Boom]] in order to do [[Quest:Junk or Bust]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Rizzle needs you to get him some Scrap Yard Junk in Sunstone Valley.
*Collect Scrap Yard Junk - /10
*Return to Rizzle
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"It's my boss, Whirly Willis. He wants junk or I’m kicked out!<br />But where am I going to get junk? Every last piece is already IN the scrap yard... Wait a second. Are you thinking what I’m thinking? Great, then <font color='#D9781A'>go get me some junk from the scrap yard</font>.<br />Please?" -Rizzle
#Collect Scrap Yard Junk - /10
#*Scrapyard Junk are located all around the [[Scrap Master Fizzbang]]'s Junkyard located in North-West [[Sunstone Valley]]
#Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"<Player Name>! You won't believe what happend... I got promoted! Crazy, right?<br />Willis was so impressed when I told him that I con- err, asked you to bring me some junk that he made me Chief of Junk Security!<br />Now all I have to do is supervise a bunch of robots. There's just one problem..." -Rizzle

